  m_Name: firstVisitorReport
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  key: firstVisitorReport
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - You came back! Glad to know that we didn't scare you off on your first day! Curation
    can be overwhelming, but it sure is rewarding!
  - Whenever you clock in after opening your museum, you'll recieve a report of how
    long you the museum was open, the number of visitors you received during that
    time, and the total donations acquired.
  - However, to add this amount to your balance, you should head over to the donation
    jar. Only then will you be able to spend your hard-earned cash on new improvements
    to the museum!
  - Press space to review the Visitor Report and Escape to put it away. Now go claim
    your donations!
  outlineTag: donation
